{{Historical article}}
{{Infobox/Character
|title = Ancient Pig
}}
The '''Ancient Pig''' can be summoned when all 7 [[Shiny Relic]]s are found. The shrine for the Ancient Pig can be found in the hub after [[Resistance Leader|Technoblade]] became mayor, as it is his second perk. When a [[Shiny Relic]] is found it will automatically go and hover by the shrine to the left of the community center, and give a copy of the relic to the player who found it. When all seven are collected, it will summon the Ancient Pig. This pig will give various special buffs to the character, including 25% skill exp buffs, a 50% stat boost when clicking on fairy souls, and double mob drops.

Upon your first click on the Ancient Pig, it will start dialogue and open a menu granting you a new pet item, the [[Flying Pig]].

