== Trivia ==
* '''Thunder''''s effect isn't very specific. It makes every island in SkyBlock rain and it brings new mobs. These new mobs are a Skeleton Horse, dropping multiple stacks of enchanted bone, and Charged Creepers, dropping enchanted gunpowder. There are no known new special drops from them.

