juicy - 2.0x more pests
salty - 3.0x more pests

base weight for each pest is 100
vinyl attracted pests have an added weight of (1000 x Mosquito bonus)
bait attracted pests have an added weight of 1000
elusive multiplier for mice
</pre>}}</ref>

