== Rates ==
Different rune rarities grant differing amounts of experience and have different success rates when fusing.
{| class="wikitable centertext"
!Rarity
!Experience
!Merge Chance
!Expected Runes to Acquire T2
!Expected Runes to Acquire T3
|-
|{{Common}}
